<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Maulana Yusuf</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. 1580</span> · <a href="/centuries/16th-century">16th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Maulana Yusuf was the second <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sultan">Sultan</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/banten">Banten</a> in western <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/java">Java</a>, ruling from 1570 to 1580. In 1579 he captured <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pakuan-pajajaran">Pakuan Pajajaran</a>, capital of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hinduism">Hindu</a> Sunda Kingdom, ending that kingdom and bringing its lands under Banten. He also developed the city of Banten with irrigation works and a great mosque.</p></div>
